    "pc_requirements": {
        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or AMD Ryzen 5 from around 2016 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 or AMD Radeon RX 580 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR. Supports standard gamepads and motion controllers. Only Windows is officially supported for VR<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Lower resolution for additional performance. Laptops can work too. Tested on 2021 Lenovo thinkpad, works smoothly with low settings and lower resolution setting. NOTE: You can always try the Demo to see how game runs.</li></ul>",
        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or AMD Ryzen 7 from 2018 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 or AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT or newer<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR. Supports standard gamepads and motion controllers. Only Windows is officially supported for VR<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Tested with high settings on 1080p. For 4k with high settings NVIDIA 4080 or AMD RX 7900 is recommended. NOTE: You can always try the Demo to see how game runs.</li></ul>"
